OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 23 FEB
OL,4,G0000FIn Their Own Words: Gruff Rhys
OL,5,     GFrom the archives, a selection of
OL,6,     GGruff Rhys interviews with 6
OL,7,     GMusic through the years. The
OL,8,     GSuper Furries frontman chats to
OL,9,     GStuart Maconie in 2011, plus a
OL,10,     G2018 Marc Riley session.
OL,11,G0100FThe Gruff Rhys Playlist
OL,12,     GGruff Rhys of Super Furry Animals
OL,13,     Gpulls together a playlist of his
OL,14,     Gfavourite tracks ahead of the
OL,15,     G6Music Festival, with some
OL,16,     GJapanese prog, Turkish pop and
OL,17,     Gthe odd birdcall.
